{"type":"message","id":"7693a00a","parentId":"841ce2ea","timestamp":"2026-03-13T18:19:13.659Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\nHmm, no crontab? Wait maybe the cron is in the project somewhere, or maybe the task is run via systemd timer? Or maybe let's first check the main.py script, that's probably the entry point, also check generate_report.py to see the generation steps, see if there's doc conversion step.\nFirst let's read main.py.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_gqh0mu1i21y0ocg556f40ztf","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/yankeeting/.openclaw/workspace/projects/daily-news-crawler/scripts/main.py"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773425951815}}
{"type":"message","id":"cd32482d","parentId":"7693a00a","timestamp":"2026-03-13T18:19:13.665Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_gqh0mu1i21y0ocg556f40ztf","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"\n每日政府网站新闻抓取主程序\n使用 Orchestrator-Constraint 模式执行\n\"\"\"\n\nimport asyncio\nimport json\nimport subprocess\nimport sys\nfrom datetime import datetime\nfrom pathlib import Path\nfrom typing import Dict, List\n\n# 路径配置\nPROJECT_DIR = Path(\"~/.openclaw/workspace/projects/daily-news-crawler\").expanduser()\nOUTPUT_DIR = Path(\"~/DailyReports\").expanduser()\n\ndef update_task_status(task_id: str, status: str, progress: Dict = None):\n    \"\"\"更新任务状态\"\"\"\n    task_file = Path(f\"~/.openclaw/workspace/status/tasks/{task_id}.json\").expanduser()\n    \n    if task_file.exists():\n        with open(task_file, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n            task_data = json.load(f)\n        \n        task_data[\"status\"] = status\n        task_data[\"updatedAt\"] = datetime.now().isoformat()\n        \n        if progress:\n            task_data[\"progress\"].update(progress)\n        \n        with open(task_file, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n            json.dump(task_data, f, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2)\n        \n        print(f\"[INFO] 任务状态更新: {status}\")\n\n\ndef run_crawler() -> bool:\n    \"\"\"运行抓取脚本\"\"\"\n    print(\"=\" * 60)\n    print(\"[INFO] 步骤 1/3: 运行抓取脚本\")\n    print(\"=\" * 60)\n    \n    crawler_script = PROJECT_DIR / \"scripts\" / \"crawler.py\"\n    \n    try:\n        result = subprocess.run(\n            [sys.executable, str(crawler_script)],\n            capture_output=True,\n            text=True,\n            timeout=3600  # 1小时超时\n        )\n        \n        print(result.stdout)\n        \n        if result.returncode != 0:\n            print(f\"[ERROR] 抓取脚本失败: {result.stderr}\")\n            return False\n        \n        print(\"[INFO] 抓取脚本完成\")\n        return True\n        \n    except subprocess.TimeoutExpired:\n        print(\"[ERROR] 抓取脚本超时\")\n        return False\n    except Exception as e:\n        print(f\"[ERROR] 抓取脚本异常: {str(e)}\")\n        return False\n\n\ndef run_report_generator() -> bool:\n    \"\"\"运行报告生成脚本\"\"\"\n    print(\"\\n\" + \"=\" * 60)\n    print(\"[INFO] 步骤 2/3: 生成报告\")\n    print(\"=\" * 60)\n    \n    # 查找最新的抓取结果文件\n    result_files = sorted(Path(\".\").glob(\"crawl_result_*.json\"), reverse=True)\n    \n    if not result_files:\n        print(\"[ERROR] 未找到抓取结果文件\")\n        return False\n    \n    latest_result = result_files[0]\n    print(f\"[INFO] 使用抓取结果: {latest_result}\")\n    \n    report_script = PROJECT_DIR / \"scripts\" / \"generate_report.py\"\n    \n    try:\n        result = subprocess.run(\n            [sys.executable, str(report_script), str(latest_result)],\n            capture_output=True,\n            text=True,\n            timeout=300  # 5分钟超时\n        )\n        \n        print(result.stdout)\n        \n        if result.returncode != 0:\n            print(f\"[ERROR] 报告生成失败: {result.stderr}\")\n            return False\n        \n        print(\"[INFO] 报告生成完成\")\n        return True\n        \n    except Exception as e:\n        print(f\"[ERROR] 报告生成异常: {str(e)}\")\n        return False\n\n\ndef send_report() -> bool:\n    \"\"\"发送报告给蔡彦庭\"\"\"\n    print(\"\\n\" + \"=\" * 60)\n    print(\"[INFO] 步骤 3/3: 发送报告\")\n    print(\"=\" * 60)\n    \n    # 查找今天生成的报告\n    today = datetime.now().strftime(\"%Y-%m-%d\")\n    md_file = OUTPUT_DIR / \"md\" / f\"{today}-日报.md\"\n    doc_file = OUTPUT_DIR / \"doc\" / f\"{today}-日报.docx\"\n    \n    if not md_file.exists() and not doc_file.exists():\n        print(\"[ERROR] 未找到生成的报告文件\")\n        return False\n    \n    print(f\"[INFO] 找到报告文件:\")\n    if md_file.exists():\n        print(f\"  - Markdown: {md_file}\")\n    if doc_file.exists():\n        print(f\"  - Word: {doc_file}\")\n    \n    # 发送给蔡彦庭 (ou_0357cf0ea2e228460b61c98e02afab7c)\n    recipient = \"ou_0357cf0ea2e228460b61c98e02afab7c\"\n    \n    print(f\"[INFO] 准备发送给蔡彦庭 ({recipient})\")\n    \n    # 这里应该调用飞书发送 API\n    # 由于当前环境限制，我们先记录发送信息\n    print(f\"[INFO] 发送 Markdown: {md_file}\")\n    print(f\"[INFO] 发送 Word: {doc_file}\")\n    \n    # 实际发送逻辑（需要根据飞书 API 实现）\n    # TODO: 调用飞书 API 发送文件\n    \n    print(\"[INFO] 报告发送完成\")\n    return True\n\n\ndef main():\n    \"\"\"主函数\"\"\"\n    print(\"=\" * 70)\n    print(\" \" * 20 + \"每日政府网站新闻抓取任务\")\n    print(\"=\" * 70)\n    print(f\"[INFO] 启动时间: {datetime.now().strftime('%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S')}\")\n    print(f\"[INFO] 任务 ID: daily-news-crawler-001\")\n    print(\"=\" * 70)\n    \n    # 更新任务状态为 running\n    update_task_status(\"daily-news-crawler-001\", \"running\", {\n        \"currentStep\": 1,\n        \"steps\": [\n            {\"name\": \"抓取网页内容\", \"status\": \"running\"},\n            {\"name\": \"生成报告文件\", \"status\": \"pending\"},\n            {\"name\": \"发送通知\", \"status\": \"pending\"}\n        ]\n    })\n    \n    # 步骤 1: 抓取\n    success = run_crawler()\n    if not success:\n        print(\"[ERROR] 抓取失败，任务终止\")\n        update_task_status(\"daily-news-crawler-001\", \"failed\")\n        return 1\n    \n    # 更新进度\n    update_task_status(\"daily-news-crawler-001\", \"running\", {\n        \"currentStep\": 2,\n        \"steps\": [\n            {\"name\": \"抓取网页内容\", \"status\": \"completed\"},\n            {\"name\": \"生成报告文件\", \"status\": \"running\"},\n            {\"name\": \"发送通知\", \"status\": \"pending\"}\n        ]\n    })\n    \n    # 步骤 2: 生成报告\n    success = run_report_generator()\n    if not success:\n        print(\"[ERROR] 报告生成失败，任务终止\")\n        update_task_status(\"daily-news-crawler-001\", \"failed\")\n        return 1\n    \n    # 更新进度\n    update_task_status(\"daily-news-crawler-001\", \"running\", {\n        \"currentStep\": 3,\n        \"steps\": [\n            {\"name\": \"抓取网页内容\", \"status\": \"completed\"},\n            {\"name\": \"生成报告文件\", \"status\": \"completed\"},\n            {\"name\": \"发送通知\", \"status\": \"running\"}\n        ]\n    })\n    \n    # 步骤 3: 发送报告\n    success = send_report()\n    if not success:\n        print(\"[WARN] 报告发送可能失败\")\n    \n    # 完成任务\n    update_task_status(\"daily-news-crawler-001\", \"completed\", {\n        \"currentStep\": 3,\n        \"steps\": [\n            {\"name\": \"抓取网页内容\", \"status\": \"completed\"},\n            {\"name\": \"生成报告文件\", \"status\": \"completed\"},\n            {\"name\": \"发送通知\", \"status\": \"completed\"}\n        ]\n    })\n    \n    print(\"\\n\" + \"=\" * 70)\n    print(\" \" * 25 + \"任务完成\")\n    print(\"=\" * 70)\n    print(f\"[INFO] 完成时间: {datetime.now().strftime('%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S')}\")\n    print(\"=\" * 70)\n    \n    return 0\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    sys.exit(main())\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773425953662}}
{"type":"message","id":"316d0d43","parentId":"cd32482d","timestamp":"2026-03-13T18:19:21.585Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\nOkay, so main.py has 3 steps: run crawler, run report generator, send report. Now let's check generate_report.py to see what it does, if it has the doc conversion step.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_fg20gskdoaeqa3ct9yuj08sh","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/yankeeting/.openclaw/workspace/projects/daily-news-crawler/scripts/generate_report.py"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773425953664}}
{"type":"message","id":"c53ba71d","parentId":"316d0d43","timestamp":"2026-03-13T18:19:21.592Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_fg20gskdoaeqa3ct9yuj08sh","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"\n日报生成脚本\n生成 Markdown 和 Word 格式的日报\n\"\"\"\n\nimport json\nimport re\nfrom datetime import datetime, timedelta\nfrom pathlib import Path\nfrom typing import List, Dict\n\n# 配置\nOUTPUT_DIR = Path(\"~/DailyReports\").expanduser()\nDAYS_BACK = 7\n\n\ndef load_crawl_results(file_path: Path) -> List[Dict]:\n    \"\"\"加载抓取结果\"\"\"\n    with open(file_path, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n        data = json.load(f)\n    return data.get(\"results\", [])\n\n\ndef categorize_news(news_list: List[Dict]) -> Dict[str, List[Dict]]:\n    \"\"\"按类别分类新闻\"\"\"\n    categories = {\n        \"国家部委\": [],\n        \"省级政策\": [],\n        \"市级政策\": [],\n        \"区级政策\": [],\n        \"行业协会\": [],\n        \"项目申报\": [],\n        \"其他\": []\n    }\n    \n    for news in news_list:\n        category = news.get(\"category\", \"其他\")\n        \n        if \"国家\" in category or \"中华人民共和国\" in category:\n            categories[\"国家部委\"].append(news)\n        elif \"省级\" in category or \"福建省\" in category:\n            categories[\"省级政策\"].append(news)\n        elif \"市级\" in category or \"厦门市\" in category:\n            categories[\"市级政策\"].append(news)\n        elif \"区级\" in category or \"思明\" in category or \"集美\" in category:\n            categories[\"区级政策\"].append(news)\n        elif \"协会\" in category or \"行业\" in category:\n            categories[\"行业协会\"].append(news)\n        elif \"申报\" in category or \"项目\" in category:\n            categories[\"项目申报\"].append(news)\n        else:\n            categories[\"其他\"].append(news)\n    \n    # 移除空类别\n    return {k: v for k, v in categories.items() if v}\n\n\ndef generate_markdown(news_list: List[Dict], date_str: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"生成 Markdown 格式的日报\"\"\"\n    \n    # 统计信息\n    total = len(news_list)\n    categorized = categorize_news(news_list)\n    \n    # 生成 Markdown\n    md = f\"\"\"# 政府网站新闻政策日报\n\n**报告日期**: {date_str}\n**数据来源**: 40个政府网站\n**生成时间**: {datetime.now().strftime(\"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\")}\n\n---\n\n## 概览\n\n| 统计项 | 数量 |\n|--------|------|\n| 监控网站数 | 40 |\n| 新增新闻/政策 | {total} |\n| 分类数量 | {len(categorized)} |\n\n---\n\n\"\"\"\n    \n    # 按类别输出\n    for category, items in categorized.items():\n        md += f\"## {category} ({len(items)}条)\\n\\n\"\n        \n        for item in items:\n            md += f\"### {item['title']}\\n\\n\"\n            md += f\"- **来源**: {item['site_name']}\\n\"\n            md += f\"- **日期**: {item['date']}\\n\"\n            md += f\"- **链接**: {item['url']}\\n\"\n            md += f\"- **摘要**: {item['summary']}\\n\\n\"\n        \n        md += \"---\\n\\n\"\n    \n    # 页脚\n    md += f\"\"\"\n---\n\n**报告生成时间**: {datetime.now().strftime(\"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\")}\n**下次生成时间**: 明天 06:45\n\n---\n\n*本报告由 OpenClaw Daily News Crawler 自动生成*\n\"\"\"\n    \n    return md\n\n\ndef generate_word_doc(md_content: str, output_path: Path):\n    \"\"\"生成 Word 文档\"\"\"\n    try:\n        from docx import Document\n        from docx.shared import Inches, Pt, RGBColor\n        from docx.enum.text import WD_ALIGN_PARAGRAPH\n        \n        doc = Document()\n        \n        # 解析 Markdown 并转换为 Word\n        lines = md_content.split('\\n')\n        i = 0\n        while i < len(lines):\n            line = lines[i]\n            \n            # 标题\n            if line.startswith('# '):\n                heading = doc.add_heading(line[2:], level=0)\n                heading.alignment = WD_ALIGN_PARAGRAPH.CENTER\n            elif line.startswith('## '):\n                doc.add_heading(line[3:], level=1)\n            elif line.startswith('### '):\n                doc.add_heading(line[4:], level=2)\n            elif line.startswith('#### '):\n                doc.add_heading(line[5:], level=3)\n            \n            # 分隔线\n            elif line == '---':\n                doc.add_paragraph('_' * 50)\n            \n            # 表格\n            elif line.startswith('| ') and '|' in line[2:]:\n                # 简单处理表格，实际应用中需要更复杂的逻辑\n                pass\n            \n            # 列表\n            elif line.startswith('- '):\n                doc.add_paragraph(line[2:], style='List Bullet')\n            elif line.startswith('* '):\n                doc.add_paragraph(line[2:], style='List Bullet')\n            elif re.match(r'^\\d+\\. ', line):\n                doc.add_paragraph(re.sub(r'^\\d+\\. ', '', line), style='List Number')\n            \n            # 普通段落\n            elif line.strip():\n                doc.add_paragraph(line)\n            \n            i += 1\n        \n        # 保存文档\n        doc.save(output_path)\n        print(f\"[INFO] Word 文档已生成: {output_path}\")\n        return True\n        \n    except ImportError:\n        print(\"[WARN] python-docx 未安装，跳过 Word 文档生成\")\n        return False\n    except Exception as e:\n        print(f\"[ERROR] Word 文档生成失败: {str(e)}\")\n        return False\n\n\ndef main():\n    \"\"\"主函数\"\"\"\n    import sys\n    \n    # 获取输入文件\n    if len(sys.argv) > 1:\n        crawl_result_file = Path(sys.argv[1])\n    else:\n        # 查找最新的抓取结果文件\n        result_files = sorted(Path(\".\").glob(\"crawl_result_*.json\"), reverse=True)\n        if result_files:\n            crawl_result_file = result_files[0]\n        else:\n            print(\"[ERROR] 未找到抓取结果文件\")\n            sys.exit(1)\n    \n    # 获取日期\n    date_str = datetime.now().strftime(\"%Y-%m-%d\")\n    \n    print(f\"[INFO] 加载抓取结果: {crawl_result_file}\")\n    news_list = load_crawl_results(crawl_result_file)\n    print(f\"[INFO] 共 {len(news_list)} 条新闻\")\n    \n    # 生成 Markdown\n    print(\"[INFO] 生成 Markdown 文档...\")\n    md_content = generate_markdown(news_list, date_str)\n    md_file = OUTPUT_DIR / \"md\" / f\"{date_str}-日报.md\"\n    with open(md_file, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n        f.write(md_content)\n    print(f\"[INFO] Markdown 已保存: {md_file}\")\n    \n    # 生成 Word 文档\n    print(\"[INFO] 生成 Word 文档...\")\n    doc_file = OUTPUT_DIR / \"doc\" / f\"{date_str}-日报.docx\"\n    success = generate_word_doc(md_content, doc_file)\n    if success:\n        print(f\"[INFO] Word 文档已保存: {doc_file}\")\n    \n    # 输出摘要\n    categorized = categorize_news(news_list)\n    print(\"\\n\" + \"=\" * 60)\n    print(\"[INFO] 日报生成完成\")\n    print(f\"[INFO] 总新闻数: {len(news_list)}\")\n    print(f\"[INFO] 分类数量: {len(categorized)}\")\n    for cat, items in categorized.items():\n        print(f\"  - {cat}: {len(items)}条\")\n    print(\"=\" * 60)\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773425961590}}
{"type":"message","id":"c3e4e644","parentId":"c53ba71d","timestamp":"2026-03-13T18:19:29.941Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\nOkay, so generate_report.py actually has a generate_word_doc function, but wait let's check: first, in the function, it tries to import docx, if import fails, it skips word generation. Also, let's check if the cron is running via something else, like maybe systemd? Wait also let's check if the docx module is installed. Also, wait we saw in the workspace there are 2026-03-13-日报.md and .txt files, but no .docx? Wait let's check the output directory ~/DailyReports.\nWait first let's check if python-docx is installed: run pip list | grep python-docx.\nAlso check if the DailyReports directory exists and what's inside it.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_ssv6b72hwp2zkpmgp2m2zhfu","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"pip list | grep python-docx && ls -la ~/DailyReports 2>/dev/null || echo \"DailyReports 目录不存在\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773425961592}}
