{"type":"message","id":"4cf09637","parentId":"b0283589","timestamp":"2026-03-13T18:19:41.257Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\nOkay, let's summarize what we found so far:\n1. 定时任务配置：当前没有配置 cron 定时任务，也没有 systemd timer 定时任务，任务没有自动化触发配置。\n2. 爬虫和生成流程代码：\n    - 入口是 main.py，分为 3 步骤：运行 crawler.py 抓取内容，运行 generate_report.py 生成报告，发送报告（发送逻辑待实现）。\n    - crawler.py 负责抓取 40 个政府网站的新闻内容，保存为 crawl_result_*.json 文件。\n    - generate_report.py 负责生成 Markdown 格式报告，并且有 generate_word_doc 函数，理论上支持生成 docx 格式文件。\n3. 缺失 doc 转换环节的原因：\n    - 首先，系统中没有安装 python3 和 pip3（或者不在 PATH 中），导致 python-docx 依赖未安装，generate_word_doc 函数中捕获 ImportError 后会跳过 Word 生成。\n    - 其次，输出目录 ~/DailyReports 及其子目录 md、doc 不存在，脚本也没有自动创建目录的逻辑，即使依赖安装了也会因为目录不存在报错导致生成失败。\n4. 当前完整生成流程步骤：\n    1. 运行 main.py 入口脚本。\n    2. 执行 crawler.py 抓取所有配置的政府网站新闻，保存为 JSON 结果文件。\n    3. 执行 generate_report.py 加载 JSON 结果：\n        a. 对新闻按类别分类。\n        b. 生成 Markdown 格式报告内容，写入到 ~/DailyReports/md/[日期]-日报.md。\n        c. 尝试导入 python-docx 模块，如果导入成功则将 Markdown 内容转换为 docx 格式，写入到 ~/DailyReports/doc/[日期]-日报.docx；如果导入失败则跳过 Word 生成。\n    4. 尝试查找生成的 md 和 docx 文件，调用飞书 API 发送给指定用户（当前发送逻辑未完整实现）。\n\nWait, but wait, let's confirm if python3 is installed? Let's run python3 --version. Also let's check if the generate_report.py actually creates directories? Let's see: no, in generate_report.py, when writing the md file, it just opens md_file = OUTPUT_DIR / \"md\" / f\"{date_str}-日报.md\", but if OUTPUT_DIR / \"md\" doesn't exist, open will throw an error, right? Wait but in the workspace we have 2026-03-13-日报.md and .txt files, so maybe they are generated in the workspace instead of the ~/DailyReports directory? Because maybe the script runs in the workspace directory, so if the OUTPUT_DIR is not created, it falls back to current directory?\nWait let's check that, also let's check if there's any run script or cron config in the project root.\nAlso let's check crawler.py to confirm.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_lrma6bfqax3b2lshcvdioyf4","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 --version 2>/dev/null || echo \"python3 未安装\" && ls -la /home/yankeeting/.openclaw/workspace/projects/daily-news-crawler/"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773425974211}}
